{"ID":"20240504170638-90t65ud","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504170638-90t65ud","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504170638-90t65ud\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240624174215-cpshl17\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611153129-h7md3ce\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2600,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240624174215-cpshl17\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"177石龙芮","type":"doc","updated":"20240814194031"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240624174215-cpshl17","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624174215-cpshl17","updated":"20240814192532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240624174215-gtk8wi0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 288px;","style":"width: 278px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙芮3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙芮3-20240624174730-q87076x.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 278px;\" parent-style=\"width: 288px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240624174713-9rvpfoe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624174713-9rvpfoe","updated":"20240814192819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 420px;","style":"width: 410px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙芮4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙芮4-20240624175106-hjttjki.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 410px;\" parent-style=\"width: 420px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 836px;","style":"width: 826px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙芮 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙芮 1-20240814192819-qov5kjv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 826px;\" parent-style=\"width: 836px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240814193555-ra8gqei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240814193555-ra8gqei","updated":"20240814193555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 756px;","style":"width: 746px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙芮 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙芮 7-20240814193401-oyr8r9x.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 746px;\" parent-style=\"width: 756px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 432px;","style":"width: 422px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙芮 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙芮 6-20240814193232-3xe3qu6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 422px;\" parent-style=\"width: 432px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240814192905-jbtpqbg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240814192905-jbtpqbg","updated":"20240814192951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 790px;","style":"width: 780px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙芮 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙芮 2-20240814192905-x7g51dj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 780px;\" parent-style=\"width: 790px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 436px;","style":"width: 426px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙芮 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙芮 3-20240814192951-vjklg3y.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 426px;\" parent-style=\"width: 436px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240814193826-vqbtf3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240814193826-vqbtf3r","updated":"20240814194020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 579px;","style":"width: 569px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙芮 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙芮 11-20240814193933-m1vkwkw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 569px;\" parent-style=\"width: 579px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 572px;","style":"width: 562px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙芮 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙芮 12-20240814194020-b0pg2h1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 562px;\" parent-style=\"width: 572px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240814193101-ucwc3gz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240814193101-ucwc3gz","updated":"20240814194031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 509px;","style":"width: 499px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙芮 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙芮 4-20240814193101-juyhglc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 499px;\" parent-style=\"width: 509px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 669px;","style":"width: 659px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙芮 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙芮 5-20240814193145-z1v1fei.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 659px;\" parent-style=\"width: 669px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240814192745-tr981ka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240814192745-tr981ka","updated":"20240814194031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 559px;","style":"width: 549px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙芮"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙芮-20240814192745-1o5f7v8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 549px;\" parent-style=\"width: 559px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 558px;","style":"width: 548px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石龙芮 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石龙芮 8-20240814193536-pbagv2b.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 548px;\" parent-style=\"width: 558px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240611153143-hwaje46","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611153143-hwaje46"}},{"ID":"20240611153140-js54i9j","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611153140-js54i9j","updated":"20240611153140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙芮《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611153140-tpx8ho1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153140-tpx8ho1","updated":"20240611153140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦平。"}]},{"ID":"20240611153140-h2e6wa0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153140-h2e6wa0","updated":"20240611153140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主风寒湿痹，心腹邪气，利关节，止烦满。久服，轻身明目，不老。一名鲁果能（《御览》作食果），一名地椹，生川泽石边。"}]},{"ID":"20240611153140-3qg0s51","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153140-3qg0s51","updated":"20240611153140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：龙芮一名姜苔，一名天豆，神农苦平岐伯酸，扁鹊李氏大寒，雷公咸无毒，五月五日采。（《御览》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611153140-xe1ng0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153140-xe1ng0s","updated":"20240611153140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名石能，一名彭根，一名天豆，生太山，五月五日采子，二月八月采皮，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611153140-34uca8t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153140-34uca8t","updated":"20240611153140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《范子计然》云：石龙芮，出三辅，色黄者善。"}]},{"ID":"20240611153226-bmw66vk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611153226-bmw66vk"}},{"ID":"20240611153227-fzl2v09","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611153227-fzl2v09","updated":"20240611153231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙芮《吴普本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611153227-x9ec8xw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153227-x9ec8xw","updated":"20240611153227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《御览》卷九百九十二、九百九十三"}]},{"ID":"20240611153227-tsp21mx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153227-tsp21mx","updated":"20240611153227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名水姜苔，一名姜苔，一名天豆。神农∶苦，平。岐伯∶酸。扁鹊、李氏∶大寒。雷公∶咸，无毒。五月五日采。"}]},{"ID":"20240611153254-ywhqd5m","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611153254-ywhqd5m"}},{"ID":"20240611153256-1qz9xg3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611153256-1qz9xg3","updated":"20240611153304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙芮《增广和剂局方药性总论》"}]},{"ID":"20240611153256-77t7lua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153256-77t7lua","updated":"20240611153256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，平，无毒。主风寒湿痹，心腹邪气，利关节，止烦满，平肾胃气，补阴气不失精茎冷。《药性论》云∶能逐诸风，主除心热躁。大戟为之使。畏∶蛇蜕。反∶吴茱出∶兖州。"}]},{"ID":"20240611153236-tcv89t2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611153236-tcv89t2"}},{"ID":"20240611153237-ape1ous","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611153237-ape1ous","updated":"20240611153244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙芮《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240611153237-q541rix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153237-q541rix","updated":"20240611153237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今有两种∶水中生者，叶光而末圆；陆生者，叶有毛而末锐。入药须生水者，陆生者又谓之天灸，取少叶揉系臂上，一夜作大泡如火烧者是。惟陆生者，补阴不足，茎常冷，失精。余如经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611153215-lze29u8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611153215-lze29u8"}},{"ID":"20240611153216-mkgjz2d","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611153216-mkgjz2d","updated":"20240611153221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙芮《本草蒙筌》"}]},{"ID":"20240611153216-rg24mot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153216-rg24mot","updated":"20240611153216"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，气平。无毒。虽生川泽，惟出益州。（属四州。）一丛数茎，一茎三叶。叶芮芮短小多缺，子缀缀色黄味辛。"}]},{"ID":"20240611153216-567jhi4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153216-567jhi4","updated":"20240611153216"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（如葶苈。）又云∶有两种类。水生者叶光泽子圆，陆生者叶有毛子锐。入药剂内，水生者佳。二月八月采皮，五月五日收子。以大戟为使，畏蛇蜕吴茱。平胃气欠和，胃热作满；补阴气不足，茎冷失精。风寒湿痹齐驱，心腹邪利关节，悦泽皮肤。久服明目轻身，令人结孕育子。其陆生者，天灸另名。取少叶揉系臂上，一宵作大泡，状如火赤。善恶悬隔，不可不知。"}]},{"ID":"20240611153157-s0sf72c","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611153157-s0sf72c"}},{"ID":"20240611153158-u5sgp1q","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611153158-u5sgp1q","updated":"20240611153209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙芮《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611153158-egeym22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153158-egeym22","updated":"20240611153204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙芮，生泰山川泽石边。陶隐居云∶近道处处有之，今惟出兖州。"}]},{"ID":"20240611153158-jwdx83l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153158-jwdx83l","updated":"20240611153158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一丛数茎，茎青紫色；每茎三叶，其叶芮芮，短小多刻缺；子如葶苈而色黄。五月采子；二月、八月采皮，阴干用。能逐诸风，除心热燥。苏恭云∶俗名水堇，苗如附子，实如桑椹，生下湿地，此乃水堇，非石龙芮也。今兖州所生者，正与本经、陶说相合，为得其真矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152902-vjemcpr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152902-vjemcpr"}},{"ID":"20240611152903-l5xktam","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152903-l5xktam","updated":"20240611152909"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙芮《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152903-ax6fvwf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152903-ax6fvwf","updated":"20240611152903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"补阴润燥．"}]},{"ID":"20240611152903-vmkx130","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152903-vmkx130","updated":"20240611152903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦平．补阴气不足，治失精茎冷．令人皮肤光泽，有子．（时珍曰∶石龙芮、乃平补之药、古方多用之、其功与枸杞覆盆子相埒、而世不知用、何哉．）逐诸风．利关节．止烦渴．明耳目．用子．（根皮功用相仿、差不及尔．）"}]},{"ID":"20240611152903-mgmofqo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152903-mgmofqo","updated":"20240611152903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶（名水堇、俗呼胡椒菜．）甘微辛．苦涩寒．除心下烦热．主寒热鼠 ．瘰 生疮．"}]},{"ID":"20240611152903-x9zrf31","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152903-x9zrf31","updated":"20240611152903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"结核聚气．（食疗本草、堇菜日干为末、油煎成膏、日三五度、摩之便瘥．）下瘀血．（易简方、血疝初起、胡椒菜 按揉之．）止霍乱．解诸毒．（唐本草、捣汁洗马毒疮、并服之、又涂蛇蝎毒、及痈肿．淮南万毕术、蛇咬生疮、生堇杵汁涂之．）"}]},{"ID":"20240611153314-1oe9rso","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611153314-1oe9rso"}},{"ID":"20240611153315-cm98210","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611153315-cm98210","updated":"20240611153322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙芮《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611153315-z9y1n8e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153315-z9y1n8e","updated":"20240611153315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，平，无毒。主风寒湿痹，心腹邪气，利关节，止烦满，平肾、胃气，补阴气不足，失精茎冷。久服轻身，明目，不老，令人皮肤光泽，有子。一名鲁果能，一名地椹，一名石能，一名彭根，一名天豆。生泰山川泽石边。五月五日采子，二月、八月采皮，阴干。（大戟为之使，畏蛇蜕皮、吴茱萸。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611153315-myew59h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153315-myew59h","updated":"20240611153315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶今出近道，子形粗，似蛇床子而扁，非真好者，人言是蓄菜子尔。东山石上所生。其叶芮芮短小，其子状如葶苈，黄色而味小辛，此乃实是也。唐本注云∶今用者，俗名水董（音谨）。苗似附子，实如桑椹，故名地椹。生下湿地，五月熟，叶、子皆味辛。山南者粒大如葵子。关中、河北者细如葶苈，气力劣于山南者。陶以细者为真，未为通论。又《别录》水董云∶主毒肿，痈疖疮，蛔虫，齿龋。臣禹锡等谨按药性论云∶石龙芮，能逐诸风，主除心热躁。"}]},{"ID":"20240611153315-tw6uqou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153315-tw6uqou","updated":"20240611153315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶石龙芮，生泰山川泽石边。陶隐居云∶近道处处有之。今唯出兖州。一丛数茎，茎青紫色，每茎三叶，其叶芮芮短小多刻缺。子如葶苈而色黄。五月采子，二月、八月采皮，阴干用。能逐诸风，除心热躁。苏恭云∶俗名水堇，苗如附子，实如桑椹。生下湿地，此乃水堇，非石龙芮也。今兖州所生者，正与《本经》、陶说相合，为得其真矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240611153315-ltre778","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153315-ltre778","updated":"20240611153315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陈藏器云∶芮子，味辛。按苏、《别录》云∶水堇，主毒肿，蛇虫，齿龋。且水堇如苏所注，定是石龙芮，更非别草。《尔雅》云∶芨，堇草。郭注云∶乌头苗也。苏又注天雄云∶石龙芮，叶似堇草，故名水堇。如此，则根据苏所注是水堇，附子是堇草。水堇、堇草二物同名也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611153315-y23xidj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153315-y23xidj","updated":"20240611153315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶石龙芮，今有两种∶水中生者，叶光而末圆。陆生者，叶有毛而末锐。入药须生水者。陆生者又谓之天灸，取少叶揉系臂上，一夜作大泡，如火烧者是。唯陆生者，补阴不足，茎常冷，失精。余如《经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152904-goz2kbh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152904-goz2kbh"}},{"ID":"20240611152917-7uw9zfx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152917-7uw9zfx","updated":"20240611152921"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙芮《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152917-s089ilk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152917-s089ilk","updated":"20240611152917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，平，无毒。主风寒湿痹，心腹邪气，利关节，止烦满，平肾胃气。补阴气不足，失精茎冷，久服轻身，明目不老，令人皮肤光泽，有子。一名鲁果能，一名地椹，一名石能，一名彭根，一名天豆。生太山川泽石边，五月五日采子，二月八月采皮，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152917-km6kbh5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152917-km6kbh5"}},{"ID":"20240611152931-pkcjm82","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152931-pkcjm82","updated":"20240611152936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙芮《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152931-9xqgc65","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152931-9xqgc65","updated":"20240611152931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙芮，有两种分别。水生者，叶光润子圆；陆生者，叶有毛，子锐。入药惟尚水生，用子形如葶苈。平胃气欠和，胃热作满，补阴气不足，茎冷失精，风寒湿痹齐驱，心腹邪气竟解，通利关节，锐泽皮肤，久服明目轻身，令人结孕有子。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152931-quxlo2z","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152931-quxlo2z"}},{"ID":"20240611152941-pw55l0h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611152941-pw55l0h","updated":"20240611152947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙芮《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611152941-vyj5p60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152941-vyj5p60","updated":"20240611152941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，平，无毒。主风寒湿痹，心腹邪气，利关节，止烦满。平肾胃气，补阴气不足，失精，茎冷。久服轻身、明目、不老，令人皮肤光泽，有子。一名鲁果能，一名地椹，一名石熊，一太山川泽石旁。五月五日采子，二月、八月采皮，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152941-zp2eoxr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152941-zp2eoxr","updated":"20240611152941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大戟为之使，畏蛇蜕、吴茱萸。 今出近道，子形粗，似蛇床子而扁，非真好者，人言是蓄菜子尔。东山石上所生，其叶芮芮短小，其子状如葶苈，黄色而味小辛，此乃实是也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152941-hyad45f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611152941-hyad45f","updated":"20240611152941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕今用者，俗名水堇。苗似附子，实如桑椹，故名地椹。生下湿地，五月熟，叶、子皆味辛。山南者粒大如葵子。关中、河北者细如葶苈，气力劣于山南者。陶以细者为真，未为通论。又《别录》水堇云∶主毒肿、痈疖疮、蛔虫、齿龋。"}]},{"ID":"20240611152941-jnfpkj3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611152941-jnfpkj3"}},{"ID":"20240611153005-ae785ju","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611153005-ae785ju","updated":"20240611153010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙芮《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240611153005-dw1eo2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153005-dw1eo2b","updated":"20240611153005"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」地椹、天豆、石能、鲁果能、水堇、苦堇、堇葵、胡椒菜彭根。"}]},{"ID":"20240611153005-sv72f90","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153005-sv72f90","updated":"20240611153005"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」（子）苦、平、无毒。（叶）甘、寒、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611153005-mqwiydh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153005-mqwiydh","updated":"20240611153005"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」（子）风湿寒痹，补肾明目；（叶）前痈肿毒疮，下瘀血，止霍乱。"}]},{"ID":"20240611153005-yxpw8jr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611153005-yxpw8jr"}},{"ID":"20240611153038-1w7pwov","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611153038-1w7pwov","updated":"20240611153109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙芮《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240611153038-44hh56v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153038-44hh56v","updated":"20240611153042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有水生、陆生两种。水生者叶光而子圆，陆生者（有大毒。）叶毛而子锐。只取水生一种用。产近水下湿地。高者尺许，其根如荠，其苗三月丛生，圆茎分枝，一枝三叶，叶青而光滑，有三尖，多细缺。四五月开细黄花，结小实，如初生桑葚，青绿色，搓散则子甚细，如葶苈子，即石龙芮也。宜于六月未老时采之，叶光子圆，庶无致误。（濒湖）"}]},{"ID":"20240611153038-x3f0spa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153038-x3f0spa","updated":"20240611153038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"子（根皮同。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611153038-id4b9ja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153038-id4b9ja","updated":"20240617115521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦酸咸，气平。主治平肾胃气，补阴气不足，治失精茎冷，并除心热燥，止烦满，驱风寒湿痹，心腹邪气，利关节，泽皮肤。方书大菟丝子丸，治肾气虚损，劳伤诸证用之。石龙芮乃平补之药，其功与枸杞、覆盆相埒。（濒湖）"}]},{"ID":"20240611153038-xfvcdif","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153038-xfvcdif","updated":"20240611153046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕石龙芮补阴气不足，与枸杞覆盆同功。惟能补阴气，而无失精茎冷之虚证。以故心热烦满，无有不除，此正平肾胃气之谓也。至于风寒湿痹，直本于同气相求者，还其真阴，而心腹之邪自净。试绎《本经》利关节微义，岂非阴气之充于关节，以致邪不能留乎？"}]},{"ID":"20240611153038-xo2ej54","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611153038-xo2ej54"}},{"ID":"20240611153116-i10mf0z","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611153116-i10mf0z","updated":"20240611153122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙芮《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240611153116-bdi82db","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153116-bdi82db","updated":"20240611153116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石龙芮苦平无毒，平肾胃补阴不足，茎冷失精多躁烦，起痹通关和心腹。"}]},{"ID":"20240611153116-obf0cz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153116-obf0cz6","updated":"20240611153116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处处有之，一丛数茎，茎青紫色，每茎茎叶其芮芮短小多刻。五月采子如葶苈，色黄；二八月采皮，阴干用。陆生者叶有毛而子锐，主平肾胃气，补阴不足，茎常冷失精，久服轻身不老，明目润肌，令人有子；生水中者，叶光而子圆，主风寒湿痹，逐诸风，利关节，治心腹邪气，烦满热燥。大戟使，畏吴茱、蛇蜕。"}]},{"ID":"20240611153117-cdfb43b","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611153117-cdfb43b"}},{"ID":"20240611153129-h7md3ce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611153129-h7md3ce"}}]}